{"step_index":671,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T18:05:51Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough updated detailing the redesign to a unified individual educator lead pipeline, 1-tap master power dialer queue, date/time entry capture, and streamlined single-card ingestion. Deployed live to Surge.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Transition to Unified Individual Educator Pipeline\n\nThe **SnapDialer** app at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) has been redesigned to align with real-world 1-card-per-educator workflows:\n\n---\n\n## 1. Summary of Changes:\n- **Abandoned the \"List\" Hierarchy:**\n  - Removed separate lists, list dates, and nested clicks.\n  - The home screen is now a **Unified Educator Lead Pipeline** showing all individual educators directly.\n- **Top KPI Summary Strip:**\n  - Shows live stats: **Total Educators**, **To Call (Pending)**, **Sit-Downs Set**, and **Follow-Ups**.\n- **1-Tap Master Power Dialing Queue:**\n  - Big green button at the top: **`▶ Start Power Dialing Queue (X Ready)`** queues all pending educators in order without needing list selection.\n  - **Recycle Unanswered Calls:** 1-tap button resets Voicemail / No Answer leads for the next pass.\n- **Live Search & Filter Tabs:**\n  - Live search across Teacher Name, School (`VOL`), Planning Period, or Room #.\n  - Filter tabs: `All`, `To Call`, `Sit-Downs`, `Callbacks`, `Unanswered`.\n- **Card-Level Direct Actions:**\n  - Each educator card shows: Planning period, years in FRS, requested times, and capture date (`Added Aug 20`).\n  - Direct 1-tap buttons: **📞 Call**, **💬 AI Text**, **👁 View Card (Proof)**, **🗑 Delete**.\n- **Streamlined Single-Card Ingestion:**\n  - Snapping a card directly verifies that teacher's profile and offers 1-tap **\"Save Educator to Pipeline\"** or **\"Save & Open Call HUD\"**.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Live Surge Deployment:\n- Deployed live to: **`https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`**\n","Description":"Walkthrough documenting unified individual educator pipeline architecture","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough for individual lead pipeline","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md with lead pipeline details"}}]}
