{"step_index":673,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T18:05:55Z","content":"**The app has been completely transformed into a unified Individual Educator Pipeline and deployed live to Surge!**\n\n---\n\n### What Changed:\n\n1. **Abandoned the \"List\" Hierarchy:**\n   - No more nested lists, list naming, or managing separate lists with dates.\n   - Every report card snapped is stored as an **individual educator lead** with their exact capture timestamp (*\"Added Aug 20, 2026\"*).\n\n2. **Unified Main Screen (Educator Pipeline):**\n   - **Live KPI Strip:** Instant counts for **Total Educators**, **To Call**, **Sit-Downs Set**, and **Follow-Ups**.\n   - **1-Tap Power Dialing:** A prominent **`▶ Start Power Dialing Queue (X Ready)`** button queues all pending educators across your database immediately.\n   - **Recycle Button:** 1-tap **\"Recycle Unanswered Leads\"** resets voicemails/no-answers for your next calling pass.\n   - **Search & Filter Tabs:** Filter by `All`, `To Call`, `Sit-Downs`, `Callbacks`, or `Unanswered`, or search by teacher name, school (`VOL`), or room number.\n\n3. **Streamlined Card Snapping:**\n   - Snapping a card directly extracts that educator's information and offers two direct options:\n     - **Save & Open Call HUD** (instant dial)\n     - **Save Educator to Pipeline** (returns to dashboard)\n\n4. **Direct Card Actions:**\n   - Every educator card in your list now has 1-tap quick buttons:\n     - **📞 Call (`phone #`)**\n     - **💬 AI Text**\n     - **👁 Card** (views the high-res photo proof of request)\n     - **🗑 Delete**\n\n---\n\n### Live Link (Updated & Live):\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\n\nOpen or refresh **SnapDialer** on your iPhone to start testing the new individual educator pipeline!"}
